    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha ntemi Koleshi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka go ng'wa Koleshi kwandya kūbiza ntemi wa Būajemi, ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkashikīlījiwa, ūyo gwalī gwahayiwa na Yelemia. Ū SEEBA wīyīta ī ng'holò ya ng'wa Koleshi, ū ntemi wa Būajemi kūbiza na ng'hūmbū ja kūfunya shilagīlo hose pyī ū mu būsugi bokwe; hūna ūshandīka alīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū ntemi Koleshi wa Būajemi alīyomba gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa ng'wigūlū waninhile py'a mabūsugi ga mu sī, na wanisolile kwīta nīmo gwa kūnzengela hekalu ī Yelusalemu, ū mu sī ya Būyudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ose ose ū mu banhū bakwe nalīnombela ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, abize hamò nang'hwe; ni ajage ī Yelusalemu, ū mu sī ya Būyudaya. Akīzenge ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli; ū Mulungu ūyo alī mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a banhū bakwe abo basaagīīla bafunye shakwinha, feza na zahabu na shikolo shingī shose shose, nūūlū na mitugo, na shakwinha mu nzīla ya wiyaabī, kūlwa nguno ya hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo īlī Yelusalemu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwigolanya kūlwa kūshoka kaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bīmīīla a batongeeji ba kaya ja bakūlūgenji babo, ū mu ng'anda ja mu Yuda na Benjamini, na bagabīji na a Balawī; būlī munhū ūyo moyo gwakwe gūkakuumiwa na Mulungu kūlwa kwīta nīmo gwa kwīzenga hang'ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA īyo īlī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pye a bazenganwa babo būyūbagunanha, būbinha shikolo sha feza na sha zahabu, na shikolo shingī, hamò na mitugo na shakwinha shingī sha mpango ntaale, a higūlya ya shose īsho shikafunyiwa mu nzīla ya wiyaabī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū ntemi Koleshi ūshifunya nī shiseme sha mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA īsho ntemi Nebukadineza walī washibūūcha kūfuma Yelusalemu, wiza ūshitūūla mu hekalu ya bamulungu bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Koleshi wa Būajemi ūnagīla Misiledasi, ūyo walī nang'hani wa sabo ja sī, ūshifunya ī shiseme shenīsho na kūshibala kū būtongi bo ng'wa Sheshibazali ūyo walī ntemi nsolwa wa Būyudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lisaabu lya shiseme ī shose lyalī īlī:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiseme ī shose ī sha zahabu nī sha feza shalī shihūmbī shitanò na magana anè na makūmi atandatū na kenda. Ī shose shenīshi ū Sheshibazali akashibūūcha ūja nasho Yelusalemu, aho bīngaga ī Babuloni a banhū abo baalī bading'wa nding'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
